speechtext:
Section 42 of the act, subsection 14 provides as follows:
Subject to the provisions of this act, all questions at meeting of creditors shall be decided by resolution carried by the majority of votes, and for such purpose the votes of creditors shall be calculated as follows :
For every claim of or over twenty-five dollars, and not exceeding two hundred dollars-one vote*
For every claim of over two hundred dollars and not exceeding five hundred dollars-two votes;
For every claim of over five hundred dollars and not exceeding one thousand dollars-three votes;
For every additional one thousand dollars or fraction thereof-one vote.
